 after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"text":" patch, which wires its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"output ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card snaps back to its resting position.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onContinueUserActivity(_:perform:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onContinueUserActivity"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSUserActivity","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSUserActivity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ()) -> "},{"kind":"keyword"